abstract: >-
  A small stdlib-only harness that runs the same calibration probe
  sets through every Youden-gate implementation found in the public
  sparkainlp-x repos (refusing-membrane, membrane-brain,
  membrane-heart, world-projection, symmetry-quantum-flip-membrane)
  on the same grid, and reports the tie-break deltas. Vendored gate
  code only, with provenance; classical synthetic toy, no medical,
  quantum-hardware, brain, or consciousness claim.
keywords:
  - refusal gate
  - Youden's J
  - calibration
  - synthetic toy
